          d="M19 3A2.9 2.9 0 0 1 22 6v12a2.9 2.9 0 0 1-3 3H5a2.9 2.9 0 0 1-3-3V6a2.9 2.9 0 0 1 3-3h14zM8.5 18v-7H6v7h2.5zM7.2 9.5a1.3 1.3 0 1 0 0-2.6 1.3 1.3 0 0 0 0 2.6zM18 18v-4.2c0-2.2-1.2-3.3-2.9-3.3a2.5 2.5 0 0 0-2.3 1.3h-.1V10H10v8h2.5v-4.1c0-1.1.4-1.8 1.3-1.8.8 0 1.2.6 1.2 1.8V18H18z"
